{
  "_doc": [
    "Virtual camera for the desktop clips (source 2560x1440) inside the vertical app card.",
    "Keys are '<sceneId>/p<partIndex>' from scenes-vertical.mjs. Each key frame: t = seconds into the part (on-screen time),",
    "cx, cy = source pixel at the centre of the card, s = scale (canvas px per source px), h = card height (card width is always 1000).",
    "The camera arrives at each key frame at time t, moving for 'move' seconds before it (ease power2.inOut). The first key frame is the starting framing.",
    "build-vertical.mjs refuses a key frame whose view would leave the source frame (s must be >= h/1440 and cx, cy within range).",
    "Edit a scene's numbers here, then run: node build-vertical.mjs"
  ],
